[120.655892, "o", "    ✓ todo — 4/4 done\r\nDirectory created and ACLs applied:\r\n\r\n* `/srv/shared` exists with `root:research`, mode `2770` (`drwxrws---`) and setgid flag\r\n* ACLs set for current and default entries:\r\n  * `group:research:rwx` / `d:g:research:rwx`\r\n  * `user:alice:rwx` / `d:u:alice:rwx`\r\n  * `user:bob:rwx` / `d:u:bob:rwx`\r\n  * mask `rwx` / `d:mask:rwx`\r\n  * others `---` / `d:other::---`\r\n\r\nVerification:\r\n```\r\n$ stat -c \"%a %A %G %U\" /srv/shared\r\n2770 drwxrws--- research root\r\n\r\n$ getfacl /srv/shared\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault:mask::rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe directory is empty, setgid is active, and default ACLs will inherit to new files/subdirectories. Users outside `research` have no access.\r\n\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=glimmer-30b tools=16 surface=c77f3a48d7b9\r\n"]
